OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CToday:FAny early mist or fog clearing, 
OL,6,Fthen a mostly dry and bright day with  
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Perhaps turning a little 
OL,8,Fcloudier in the far west during the    
OL,9,Flate afternoon. Winds generally light  
OL,10,Fand feeling rather chilly.             
OL,12,CTonight:FBreaks in the cloud will      
OL,13,Fallow temperatures to fall and frost   
OL,14,Fto form before turning cloudy with     
OL,15,Fpatchy rain in the west by the         
OL,16,Fmorning. Feeling chilly with light     
OL,17,Fwinds.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
